      {"function": "explanation", "scene_type": "zonk_diagram", "source_ids": ["S1", "S2"],
       "spoken": "What's inside? It starts as a dense flower head: one hundred to two hundred flowers, packed tight. Each turns into a berry-like fruitlet. No hands, so I point with my leaf.",
