      {"function": "demonstration", "scene_type": "zonk_zoom", "source_ids": ["S1", "S2"],
       "spoken": "Closer. The fruitlets fuse into one juicy fruit, shaped like a cone. Through the middle runs the stem, a fibrous core. Technical term: syncarp. Sounds like a carp with rhythm.",
